      "faq": {
        "kicker": "Good questions",
        "heading": "Before Lane makes the introduction.",
        "characterImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vipin-go/lane-landing-page/main/assets/media/lane-mascot-transparent.png",
        "items": [
          {
            "question": "Is Lane only for founders looking for investors?",
            "answer": "No. The service is deliberately two-sided: investors use Lane to find founders, founders use Lane to find investors, potential co-founders find each other, and startups find another startup with a plausible customer or collaboration fit."
          },
          {
            "question": "Is Lane a matching app?",
            "answer": "No. A human operator reads the intake and proposes one pairing at a time. There is no public deck, swipe feed, attendee directory, or automated matching engine."
          },
          {
            "question": "Will everyone see my details?",
            "answer": "No. Intake stays private. Each proposed introduction is shown only to the two relevant sides, and direct contact details stay hidden until both accept."
          },
          {
            "question": "What if I pass on a proposed pairing?",
            "answer": "Lane records the pass privately and moves on. The other side is not given your contact details, and there is no public rejection or ranking."
          },
          {
            "question": "What happens after both sides accept?",
            "answer": "Lane confirms a time and a table or quiet corner. You receive two names and the exact location only after both yeses are in."
          },
          {
            "question": "How does the meeting guarantee work?",
            "answer": "The guarantee applies to the track selected at signup: three accepted meetings on the current event calendar, or the founder-side fee is refunded. Lane books the meeting, not the round, co-founder, customer, or deal."
          }
        ]
      },
